  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Seminar on Horticulture sector roadmap for Southwest Nigeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The developed horticulture roadmap (study) aims to generate a clear overview of the horticultural sector in six states in the Southwest of Nigeria by analysing the current product flows, the stakeholders and its challenges and providing scenarios for future investment opportunities within the sector.This seminar in Lagos will serve as a platform to validate and showcase the roadmap, facilitate meaningful dialogue and gather insights, and foster partnerships that will drive its successful implementation.</narrative>
  </description>
